I am walking along the street in Fort Kochi.
Suddenly, the sky gets dark.
A heavy rain begins.
This is the June monsoon.
Five months ago, I did not know about this rain.
Now, I always keep an umbrella with me.
I quickly open my umbrella.
But the wind is very strong.
For this heavy rain, that small umbrella is not enough.
I need a place to stand.
I look around.
A little away, I see a big building.
That is the Indo-Portuguese Museum.
I run towards that building.
I quickly reach the museum's porch.
I decide to stand inside this until the rain stops.
This is a good place to escape from the rain.
